  "subtitle": "A reversible, textured beanie knitted entirely in garter stitch in the round.",
  "excerpt": "A bottom-up beanie worked entirely in garter stitch in the round on chunky yarn. Every other round is purled to produce the horizontal ridges on the right side. The reversible fabric lies flat and is warm and quick to knit. Fits adult heads 54 to 61 cm.",
