    {
      "slug": "garter-in-the-round",
      "term": "Garter stitch in the round",
      "definition": "When knitting in the round, garter stitch requires alternating a knit round and a purl round to produce the same horizontal ridge effect that knitting every flat row creates."
    },
    {
      "slug": "magic-loop",
      "term": "Magic loop",
      "definition": "A method of knitting a small circumference on one long circular needle by pulling a loop of cable through the work at the halfway point."
    }
